// WASI module umbrella: Preview 2 (sync/pollable) and Preview 3
// (async/component-model) live in their OWN nested contract packages —
// this parent package carries only the version marker.
//
// Usage:
//   import @vibe/wasi/p2 { listen, accept, respond }     // fd-based HTTP
//   import @vibe/wasi/p3 { Handler, Request, Response }  // async component handler
//
// #897 (ADR-0070 Phase 3): `version` was `export let version = "0.0.1"`
// directly in the old index.vibe facade — a real importable binding, not
// just contract metadata (Codex review precedent, PR #914).
